        <mxCell id="VWZiYS4LC1N6ijENlrWA-64" value="Encodes video to different quality for user&#39;s bandwidth&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Also makes the manifest files&lt;div&gt;.m3u8 for HLS -&amp;gt; HTTP Live Streaming&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;.mpd for DASH -&amp;gt; Dynamic Adaptive Streaming over HTTP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;for Live streaming like cricket matches -&amp;gt; HLS protocol is used&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;for streaming movies / shows -&amp;gt; DASH protocol is used&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
