        <mxCell id="VWZiYS4LC1N6ijENlrWA-93" value="Change Data Capture (CDC) Pipeline is used to detect if there are any changes in the DB and then inform the Elastic Search Engine.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Proxy Design Pattern is used when user searched the movies, instead of directly calling the video DB, we give some metadata about the movie, through proxy-pattern we call the mongo DB.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
